      "note": "ssot-rarity.md 3.8 requires rung 100 to have at least one DETERMINISTIC source. This is it: a first clear is recorded, fires once per (player_id, source_kind, source_id), and never rolls. WHICH content id carries it is the owner's -- rift-tyrant is the deepest shipped wave, a starting choice, not a ruling. Promotion (module 15) is the other real source, so this grant can be dropped without leaving 3.8 unsatisfied."
